@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 创建任务；运行 examples.tasks:app
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"学习 FastAPI"}

> {% client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id); %}

### 列表和筛选
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?completed=false&offset=0&limit=10

### 获取刚创建的任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### 完整替换
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"完成入门","completed":true}

### 校验失败：预期 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"   "}

### 删除：预期 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### 删除后查询：预期 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
